{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The caliper feels useful because measuring screws and fittings would help me match hardware for small repairs.",
    "The locking nuts connect to my recent interest in fasteners that stay secure, although I would skip this particular set because its SAE sizes do not match my metric screws."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Printer filament does not help me fasten, mount, or organize things, and I have no current printing project.",
    "Different filament colors and finishes do not make these supplies more useful to me; even the six-spool pack has no purpose for my current needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in practical hardware seems to have been stretched into an interest in supplies for making things with a 3D printer.",
    "The repeated filament choices seem to assume I need printing material before there is any sign that I use a printer."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent washers, screws, and magnetic hooks point toward securing and mounting things, so usefulness for those jobs matters to me.",
    "Hardware compatibility matters: my recent screw assortment uses metric sizes, so an SAE nut assortment is less useful even though locking nuts interest me."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my hardware needs but mostly mistook them for an interest in 3D printing supplies."
}"}
